## General safety precautions

Before servicing the unit:

1. Press the emergency stop.
2. Switch off the main power.
3. Apply lockout / tagout.
4. Wait for all motion to stop completely.

Confirm the following before restoring power:

{% list type="checkmark" %}
* All guards are refitted.
* No tools remain on or inside the unit.
* The work area is clear of personnel.
{% /list %}

> When in doubt, stop and ask a supervisor.
